{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019npZodckDFJqbVSihwWGtp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic\n2\t\n3\t## Test file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`\n4\t\n5\t### TestTheDawningArchaicProperties (8 tests)\n6\tValidates all static card properties against the spec:\n7\t- `test_is_creature`: Card must be a Creature subclass\n8\t- `test_name`: Name must be \"The Dawning Archaic\"\n9\t- `test_mana_cost`: Mana cost must be {10} (generic only)\n10\t- `test_power_toughness`: Must be 7/7\n11\t- `test_is_legendary`: Must have Legendary supertype\n12\t- `test_has_avatar_subtype`: Must have \"Avatar\" subtype\n13\t- `test_has_reach`: Must have Reach keyword\n14\t- `test_has_creature_type`: Must have CREATURE card type\n15\t\n16\t### TestTheDawningArchaicCostReduction (6 tests)\n17\tValidates the cost reduction mechanic: \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\"\n18\t- `test_one_instant_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one`: Single instant = 1 reduction\n19\t- `test_one_sorcery_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one`: Single sorcery = 1 reduction\n20\t- `test_multiple_instants_and_sorceries`: 3 cards = 3 reduction\n21\t- `test_creatures_in_graveyard_do_not_reduce_cost`: Non-instant/sorcery cards ignored\n22\t- `test_mixed_card_types_only_counts_instants_sorceries`: Mixed graveyard only counts relevant types\n23\t- `test_opponent_graveyard_does_not_count`: Only \"your\" graveyard matters\n24\t- `test_reduction_up_to_ten`: 10 cards should give full reduction (free cast)\n25\t\n26\t### TestTheDawningArchaicTriggerRegistration (4 tests)\n27\tValidates that the attack trigger is properly registered:\n28\t- `test_registers_attack_trigger`: register_triggers adds triggers to the manager\n29\t- `test_registered_trigger_watches_attacks_event`: Trigger watches AttacksTriggeredEvent\n30\t- `test_trigger_condition_matches_self_attacking`: Condition fires for this creature\n31\t- `test_trigger_condition_does_not_match_other_creature`: Condition does not fire for other creatures\n32\t\n33\t### TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTriggerTargeting (5 tests)\n34\tValidates that the attack trigger targets instant/sorcery in graveyard:\n35\t- `test_get_targets_returns_at_least_one_requirement`: At least one target requirement\n36\t- `test_get_targets_zone_is_graveyard`: Target zone is graveyard\n37\t- `test_get_targets_filter_accepts_instant`: Filter accepts instants\n38\t- `test_get_targets_filter_accepts_sorcery`: Filter accepts sorceries\n39\t- `test_get_targets_filter_rejects_creature`: Filter rejects creatures\n40\t\n41\t### TestTheDawningArchaicFreeCast (2 tests)\n42\tValidates the free-cast-from-graveyard mechanic:\n43\t- `test_attack_trigger_casts_spell_from_graveyard`: Trigger resolves and moves spell from graveyard\n44\t- `test_free_cast_does_not_require_mana`: No mana needed for the free cast\n45\t\n46\t### TestTheDawningArchaicExileReplacement (2 tests)\n47\tValidates the replacement clause: \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n48\t- `test_cast_spell_goes_to_exile_not_graveyard`: Free-cast spell ends in exile\n49\t- `test_normal_spells_still_go_to_graveyard`: Other spells unaffected\n50\t\n51\t### TestTheDawningArchaicEdgeCases (2 tests)\n52\t- `test_empty_graveyard_no_valid_target`: No crash with empty graveyard\n53\t- `test_graveyard_with_only_creatures_no_valid_target`: No crash when no valid targets exist\n54\t\n55\t## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n56\t- \"you may cast\" optionality: The \"may\" wording implies the player can choose not to cast. Testing player choice is complex and would require scripting DeterministicPlayer decisions through the full combat pipeline, which is out of scope for unit-level card tests.\n57\t- Full integration with declare_attackers: The attack trigger is tested via direct fire_event calls rather than the full combat pipeline, which is the pattern used in the engine.\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"ebbfb06b-6b0d-425d-aeca-221291a41055","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:13:34.559Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 1 — The Dawning Archaic\n\n## Test file: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py`\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicProperties (8 tests)\nValidates all static card properties against the spec:\n- `test_is_creature`: Card must be a Creature subclass\n- `test_name`: Name must be \"The Dawning Archaic\"\n- `test_mana_cost`: Mana cost must be {10} (generic only)\n- `test_power_toughness`: Must be 7/7\n- `test_is_legendary`: Must have Legendary supertype\n- `test_has_avatar_subtype`: Must have \"Avatar\" subtype\n- `test_has_reach`: Must have Reach keyword\n- `test_has_creature_type`: Must have CREATURE card type\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicCostReduction (6 tests)\nValidates the cost reduction mechanic: \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\"\n- `test_one_instant_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one`: Single instant = 1 reduction\n- `test_one_sorcery_in_graveyard_reduces_by_one`: Single sorcery = 1 reduction\n- `test_multiple_instants_and_sorceries`: 3 cards = 3 reduction\n- `test_creatures_in_graveyard_do_not_reduce_cost`: Non-instant/sorcery cards ignored\n- `test_mixed_card_types_only_counts_instants_sorceries`: Mixed graveyard only counts relevant types\n- `test_opponent_graveyard_does_not_count`: Only \"your\" graveyard matters\n- `test_reduction_up_to_ten`: 10 cards should give full reduction (free cast)\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicTriggerRegistration (4 tests)\nValidates that the attack trigger is properly registered:\n- `test_registers_attack_trigger`: register_triggers adds triggers to the manager\n- `test_registered_trigger_watches_attacks_event`: Trigger watches AttacksTriggeredEvent\n- `test_trigger_condition_matches_self_attacking`: Condition fires for this creature\n- `test_trigger_condition_does_not_match_other_creature`: Condition does not fire for other creatures\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicAttackTriggerTargeting (5 tests)\nValidates that the attack trigger targets instant/sorcery in graveyard:\n- `test_get_targets_returns_at_least_one_requirement`: At least one target requirement\n- `test_get_targets_zone_is_graveyard`: Target zone is graveyard\n- `test_get_targets_filter_accepts_instant`: Filter accepts instants\n- `test_get_targets_filter_accepts_sorcery`: Filter accepts sorceries\n- `test_get_targets_filter_rejects_creature`: Filter rejects creatures\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicFreeCast (2 tests)\nValidates the free-cast-from-graveyard mechanic:\n- `test_attack_trigger_casts_spell_from_graveyard`: Trigger resolves and moves spell from graveyard\n- `test_free_cast_does_not_require_mana`: No mana needed for the free cast\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicExileReplacement (2 tests)\nValidates the replacement clause: \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n- `test_cast_spell_goes_to_exile_not_graveyard`: Free-cast spell ends in exile\n- `test_normal_spells_still_go_to_graveyard`: Other spells unaffected\n\n### TestTheDawningArchaicEdgeCases (2 tests)\n- `test_empty_graveyard_no_valid_target`: No crash with empty graveyard\n- `test_graveyard_with_only_creatures_no_valid_target`: No crash when no valid targets exist\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n- \"you may cast\" optionality: The \"may\" wording implies the player can choose not to cast. Testing player choice is complex and would require scripting DeterministicPlayer decisions through the full combat pipeline, which is out of scope for unit-level card tests.\n- Full integration with declare_attackers: The attack trigger is tested via direct fire_event calls rather than the full combat pipeline, which is the pattern used in the engine.\n","numLines":58,"startLine":1,"totalLines":58}}}
