{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n## Task\nImplement the card **sos_1** (\"The Dawning Archaic\") so that ALL tests pass. You MUST NOT modify any test file.\n\n## Card spec\nRead the card spec at: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_spec.json`\n\n## Test files\nRead the test file list at: `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-files.txt`\nThen read the actual test file(s) listed there to understand what's expected.\n\n## Implementation target\nEdit: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py`\n\n## References\n- Read `/workspace/AGENTS.md` and `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` for workspace rules.\n- Read `/workspace/test_utils.md` for the test utility API.\n- FDN reference implementations (read for patterns):\n  - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_13/card_impl.py`\n  - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_142/card_impl.py`\n  - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/card_impl.py`\n  - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_215/card_impl.py`\n  - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_244/card_impl.py`\n- Engine source modules (read for API discovery — they have rich docstrings):\n  - `/workspace/engine/card.py`\n  - `/workspace/engine/events.py`\n  - `/workspace/engine/triggers.py`\n  - `/workspace/engine/replacement_effects.py`\n  - `/workspace/engine/zones.py`\n  - `/workspace/engine/types.py`\n- For rules questions, grep `/workspace/RULEBOOK.txt`.\n- Read `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` and `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json`.\n\n## Output\n1. Implement the card in `card_impl.py` making all tests pass.\n2. You may also modify engine files if needed (add methods, classes, helpers — but do NOT rename/move/delete existing things).\n3. Write a brief diff summary to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-rationale.md`.\n4. Write the list of modified files (one per line) to `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-files.txt`.\n5. Update `/workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json` — upsert the card entry matching `\"card\": \"sos_1\"`. Entry shape:\n   ```json\n   {\"card\": \"sos_1\", \"tests\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}], \"implementation\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"summary\": \"...\"}]}\n   ```\n\n## Verification\nRun the tests with: `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py -v` and make sure they all pass.\nAlso run: `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -v --tb=short` to verify no regressions.\n\n## Important\n- Do NOT modify any test file listed in test-files.txt.\n- If a test is genuinely wrong, return DISPUTE instead of modifying it.\n\nReturn a status summary:\n```\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: N\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: ...\n```\nor\n```\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: N\ndisputed_tests: [list]\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-dispute.md\nnotes: ...\n```\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QoZuWJUg12PkR3NffFHhTT","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"0a5ceaae-4da0-44fb-a41b-3b896ab7f518","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:13:50.732Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_1"}
