{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MP1WdLJQQQzqVQ8CtEXNHU","type":"tool_result","content":"130\t    --------\n131\t    1. **Timing check** — instants (and cards with flash) can be cast\n132\t       whenever the player has priority; everything else requires\n133\t       sorcery-speed timing.\n134\t    2. **can_cast** — ask the card whether it can legally be cast.\n135\t    3. **Hand check** — the card must be in the player's hand.\n136\t    4. **Move hand → stack zone** — remove the card from the hand and\n137\t       place it into the player's stack zone.\n138\t    5. **Choose targets** — if the card specifies targets (via\n139\t       :meth:`CardImpl.get_targets`), the player is asked to choose.\n140\t    6. **Mana check / payment** — the player's mana pool must be able to\n141\t       pay the card's mana cost.  If payment fails, the card is rolled\n142\t       back from the stack zone to the hand.\n143\t    7. **Call on_cast** — invoke the card's ``on_cast`` hook.\n144\t    8. **Push StackObject** — push a :class:`StackObject` whose\n145\t       ``on_resolve`` callback handles resolution.\n146\t\n147\t    Raises:\n148\t        CastingError: If any legality check fails.\n149\t    \"\"\"\n150\t    # 1. Timing\n151\t    if not can_cast_at_instant_speed(card) and not is_sorcery_speed(game, player):\n152\t        raise CastingError(\n153\t            f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — sorcery-speed timing not met\"\n154\t        )\n155\t\n156\t    # 2. can_cast\n157\t    if not card.can_cast(game):\n158\t        raise CastingError(f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — can_cast returned False\")\n159\t\n160\t    # 3. Hand check\n161\t    hand = game.get_hand(player)\n162\t    if not hand.contains(card):\n163\t        raise CastingError(f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — card not in hand\")\n164\t\n165\t    # 4. Move card from hand to stack zone\n166\t    stack_zone = player.zones[Zone.STACK]\n167\t    hand.remove(card)\n168\t    stack_zone.add(card)\n169\t\n170\t    # Clear any stale colors_spent from a prior cast before new payment.\n171\t    if hasattr(card, \"colors_spent\"):\n172\t        del card.colors_spent\n173\t\n174\t    # 5. Choose targets\n175\t    target_specs = card.get_targets(game)\n176\t    chosen_targets: list[Any] = []\n177\t    if target_specs:\n178\t        for spec in target_specs:\n179\t            target = player.choose_target(target_specs, spec)\n180\t            # Validate against filter_fn if the spec provides one\n181\t            filter_fn = getattr(spec, \"filter_fn\", None)\n182\t            if filter_fn is not None and target is not None:\n183\t                if not filter_fn(target):\n184\t                    stack_zone.remove(card)\n185\t                    hand.add(card)\n186\t                    raise CastingError(\n187\t                        f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — chosen target does not \"\n188\t                        f\"satisfy filter: {getattr(spec, 'description', '')}\"\n189\t                    )\n190\t            chosen_targets.append(target)\n191\t\n192\t    # 5b. Protection check — reject targets that have protection from this\n193\t    #     spell (the T in DEBT).\n194\t    from engine.protection import has_protection_from\n195\t\n196\t    for target in chosen_targets:\n197\t        if has_protection_from(target, card):\n198\t            # Rollback: move card from stack zone back to hand\n199\t            stack_zone.remove(card)\n200\t            hand.add(card)\n201\t            raise CastingError(\n202\t                f\"Cannot cast {card.name!r} — target has protection from this spell\"\n203\t            )\n204\t\n205\t    # Targets are stored on the StackObject (not the card) and passed\n206\t    # through the resolve pipeline via on_resolve(game, targets=...).\n207\t\n208\t    # 6. Mana check / payment (rollback on failure)\n209\t    # Ensure the card knows its controller so that cost_reduction() hooks"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011fxuJcAY3