{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WmCHcELngC22fMjF1GUmXw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012qGWBLjdQ5Kwx4HN5kyiBh","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 4: Together as One\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py`\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneProperties (4 tests)\nValidates static card metadata matches the card spec:\n- `test_is_sorcery` — Card is a Sorcery subclass.\n- `test_name` — Name is \"Together as One\".\n- `test_mana_cost` — Mana cost is `{6}`.\n- `test_has_sorcery_card_type` — CardType.SORCERY is in card_types.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneTargeting (5 tests)\nThe card specifies \"target player\" (for drawing) and \"any target\" (for damage). This requires two TargetRequirements.\n- `test_returns_two_target_requirements` — get_targets() returns exactly 2 items.\n- `test_each_requirement_is_target_requirement` — Both are TargetRequirement instances.\n- `test_first_target_accepts_player` — The player-draw target accepts a player object.\n- `test_second_target_accepts_player` — \"Any target\" accepts a player.\n- `test_second_target_accepts_creature` — \"Any target\" accepts a creature.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneConverge (1 test)\nThe Converge mechanic relies on a `colors_spent` attribute (per FDN 205 pattern).\n- `test_colors_spent_attribute_exists` — Card has a colors_spent attribute.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneDrawCards (2 tests)\nValidates the \"target player draws X cards\" effect.\n- `test_target_player_draws_x_cards` — With 3 colors spent and target = opponent, opponent draws 3.\n- `test_caster_can_target_self_for_draw` — Caster can target themselves for draws.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneDamage (3 tests)\nValidates the \"deals X damage to any target\" effect.\n- `test_deals_x_damage_to_target_player` — Deals 3 damage to a player with 3 colors.\n- `test_deals_x_damage_to_creature` — Deals 2 damage to a creature with 2 colors.\n- `test_five_colors_deals_five_damage` — Full WUBRG deals 5 damage.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneLifeGain (2 tests)\nValidates the \"you gain X life\" effect.\n- `test_controller_gains_x_life` — Controller gains 3 life with 3 colors.\n- `test_five_colors_gains_five_life` — Controller gains 5 life with 5 colors.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneFullResolution (1 test)\nValidates all three effects occur together in a single resolution.\n- `test_all_three_effects_with_three_colors` — Draw 3, deal 3 damage to creature, gain 3 life all in one call.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneZeroColors (3 tests)\nEdge case: X = 0 means all effects are zero.\n- `test_zero_colors_no_cards_drawn` — No cards drawn when X = 0.\n- `test_zero_colors_no_damage` — No damage dealt when X = 0.\n- `test_zero_colors_no_life_gain` — No life gained when X = 0.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneNoTargets (2 tests)\nEdge case: missing or empty chosen_targets should not crash.\n- `test_no_chosen_targets_does_not_raise` — No chosen_targets attribute set.\n- `test_empty_chosen_targets_does_not_raise` — Empty list for chosen_targets.\n\n### TestTogetherAsOneConvergeWithColorList (2 tests)\nThe engine casting pipeline sets `colors_spent` as a list of Color enum objects. The card must handle both int (test convenience) and list (engine reality) formats.\n- `test_colors_spent_as_list_determines_x` — List of 3 Color enums means X = 3.\n- `test_colors_spent_as_list_gains_life` — Life gain correct with list-format colors_spent.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n- **Countered spell**: The card going to graveyard after being countered is engine behavior, not card-specific.\n- **Protection from the spell**: Protection preventing damage is engine-level behavior tested in engine_tests.\n- **Drawing from empty library**: The draw-from-empty-library SBA is engine behavior, not specific to this card.\n- **Multiple casts of the same card**: No unique per-card state that would differ on re-cast beyond colors_spent, which is reset by the engine.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":116,"cache_read_input_tokens":63671,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":116,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y7Qz4pTXecHCahQvRW24SL","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"1ae244d7-711c-4416-b15e-22a4a92c26dd","request_id":"req_011CbUj1XhgtiVVAnzQwh1RQ","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_4"}
