{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CRSnMbZChKWQrjfxMwp1c8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SdknZyykAv5V516iUfKncP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_4 (Together as One)\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n1. **Sorcery base class**: Extended `Sorcery` from `engine.card` since this is a sorcery spell. The `Sorcery.__init__` automatically adds `CardType.SORCERY` to `card_types`.\n\n2. **Converge via `colors_spent` attribute**: Following the FDN 205 (Wardens of the Cycle) pattern, the card tracks `colors_spent` as an attribute. Default is `0` (int). The `_get_x()` helper handles both int and list-of-Color-enum formats -- the engine casting pipeline may set it as a list of `Color` enums, while tests set it directly as an int.\n\n3. **Two TargetRequirements**: `get_targets()` returns exactly two `TargetRequirement` objects:\n   - First: \"target player\" -- filters on `hasattr(obj, \"life\")` (the standard player detection pattern).\n   - Second: \"any target\" -- accepts players (have `life`) and creatures/planeswalkers (have `card_types` containing CREATURE or PLANESWALKER).\n\n4. **Resolution order**: `on_resolve()` follows oracle text order: draw X cards for target player, deal X damage to any target, controller gains X life. Uses `engine.game.draw_card` and `engine.game.deal_damage` for correct event firing.\n\n5. **Edge case handling**: Gracefully handles missing/empty `chosen_targets` (no crash), zero colors spent (all effects are no-ops), and self-targeting (caster can target themselves for draw).\n\n## Conventions\n\n- `kwargs.setdefault()` pattern for card properties, consistent with FDN 205.\n- `colors_spent` attribute initialized in `__init__`, set externally by cast logic or test code.\n- No engine modifications were needed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":123,"cache_read_input_tokens":38584,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":123,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0197ndBubDQvNnasBuqjywDt","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"a6d4ca5f-b1a0-45d7-950a-30e249eb2588","request_id":"req_011CbUjAYJf3nycxB18owWEP","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_4"}
