{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MMS4gSQj97DJnooHRo5aqF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017Y3HaVhjoHhqGYac833QPu","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revised Implementation Rationale for sos_4\n\n## Change Summary\n\nAdded `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent` firing after the life gain increment in `on_resolve`.\n\n## What was fixed\n\nThe original implementation directly incremented `controller.life` without firing `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent`. Multiple FDN cards (fdn_4, fdn_9, fdn_11, fdn_28, fdn_120, fdn_125, fdn_135, fdn_137, fdn_178) register triggers for this event. Without firing it, any life-gain triggers on the battlefield would not activate when Together as One resolves.\n\n## Pattern followed\n\nFollowed the established pattern from fdn_137 (line 79) and fdn_9 (line 52):\n```python\ncontroller.life += x\ngame.trigger_manager.fire_event(game, GainsLifeTriggeredEvent(player=controller, amount=x))\n```\n\nThe event is only fired when `x > 0` (inside the existing guard), matching the convention that zero-amount life gain does not fire triggers.\n\n## Files modified\n\n- `cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py` -- Added `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent` import and fire_event call after life gain.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":154,"cache_read_input_tokens":29491,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":154,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012CgXSfniDjDZnZQjqNyDa3","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"6cc228e2-4fc6-4542-8d2a-fcaf47ea3543","request_id":"req_011CbUjRh2wXZmpajXJoGbCJ","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_4 per review