{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GWujrZXrBkgz9a136J47PV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n2\t\n3\t## File: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n4\t\n5\t### TestEmeritusOfTruceProperties (6 tests)\n6\tValidates static card data against the card spec:\n7\t- `test_is_creature`: Card must be a Creature instance.\n8\t- `test_name`: Card name should be \"Emeritus of Truce\" (the front face).\n9\t- `test_mana_cost`: {1}{W}{W} for the creature half.\n10\t- `test_power_toughness`: 3/3 as printed.\n11\t- `test_has_creature_type`: CardType.CREATURE in card_types.\n12\t- `test_has_cat_cleric_subtypes`: Both \"Cat\" and \"Cleric\" subtypes present.\n13\t\n14\t### TestEmeritusOfTruceETBTriggerRegistration (4 tests)\n15\tValidates the ETB trigger registration:\n16\t- `test_registers_etb_trigger`: register_triggers adds at least one trigger.\n17\t- `test_registered_trigger_watches_etb_event`: Trigger watches EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent.\n18\t- `test_trigger_condition_matches_self_entering`: Condition returns True for this permanent's ETB.\n19\t- `test_trigger_condition_does_not_match_other_permanent`: Condition returns False for other permanents.\n20\t\n21\t### TestEmeritusOfTruceTargeting (3 tests)\n22\tValidates the targeting requirement for the ETB trigger:\n23\t- `test_returns_at_least_one_target_requirement`: get_targets returns a list with at least one requirement.\n24\t- `test_target_requirement_is_valid_type`: Returned object is a TargetRequirement.\n25\t- `test_target_accepts_player`: Filter accepts any player (either player is a valid target).\n26\t\n27\t### TestEmeritusOfTruceTokenCreation (6 tests)\n28\tValidates the Inkling token creation on ETB:\n29\t- `test_target_player_gets_token`: Target player receives exactly one token.\n30\t- `test_token_is_creature`: Token is a Creature instance with is_token=True.\n31\t- `test_token_is_inkling`: Token has \"Inkling\" subtype.\n32\t- `test_token_power_toughness`: Token is 1/1.\n33\t- `test_token_has_flying`: Token has Keyword.FLYING.\n34\t- `test_controller_can_target_self_for_token`: Controller can target themselves.\n35\t\n36\t### TestEmeritusOfTrucePreparedCondition (4 tests)\n37\tValidates the conditional prepared designation:\n38\t- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures`: Prepared when opponent has strictly more creatures.\n39\t- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_equal_creatures`: Not prepared when counts are equal.\n40\t- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_more_creatures`: Not prepared when controller has more.\n41\t- `test_becomes_prepared_targeting_self_opponent_still_has_more`: Prepared even when self-targeting if opponent still has more.\n42\t\n43\t### TestEmeritusOfTruceEdgeCases (4 tests)\n44\tEdge cases and boundary conditions:\n45\t- `test_on_resolve_no_chosen_targets_does_not_crash`: No crash when chosen_targets is unset.\n46\t- `test_on_resolve_empty_chosen_targets_does_not_crash`: No crash when chosen_targets is empty.\n47\t- `test_opponent_has_no_creatures_token_given_to_opponent`: Equal counts (1 vs 1) does not trigger prepared.\n48\t- `test_token_on_opponent_side_tips_balance`: Giving token to opponent can tip the balance to trigger prepared.\n49\t\n50\t## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n51\t\n52\t- **Swords to Plowshares prepare spell functionality**: The prepared mechanic\n53\t  involves creating a copy of the prepare spell in exile and allowing it to be\n54\t  cast. This requires engine infrastructure for \"prepared designation\" and\n55\t  \"create a copy of the prepare spell\" that does not currently exist in the\n56\t  engine. Documented in untestable.json.\n57\t- **Token color identity (white AND black)**: The engine does not have a clear\n58\t  \"colors\" attribute on creatures in the current API, so we cannot assert\n59\t  white-and-black color identity on the token. We verify subtypes and keywords\n60\t  instead.\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"39ae0bbe-6f62-4a28-a25f-590d315c8dae","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:34:19.095Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTruceProperties (6 tests)\nValidates static card data against the card spec:\n- `test_is_creature`: Card must be a Creature instance.\n- `test_name`: Card name should be \"Emeritus of Truce\" (the front face).\n- `test_mana_cost`: {1}{W}{W} for the creature half.\n- `test_power_toughness`: 3/3 as printed.\n- `test_has_creature_type`: CardType.CREATURE in card_types.\n- `test_has_cat_cleric_subtypes`: Both \"Cat\" and \"Cleric\" subtypes present.\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTruceETBTriggerRegistration (4 tests)\nValidates the ETB trigger registration:\n- `test_registers_etb_trigger`: register_triggers adds at least one trigger.\n- `test_registered_trigger_watches_etb_event`: Trigger watches EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent.\n- `test_trigger_condition_matches_self_entering`: Condition returns True for this permanent's ETB.\n- `test_trigger_condition_does_not_match_other_permanent`: Condition returns False for other permanents.\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTruceTargeting (3 tests)\nValidates the targeting requirement for the ETB trigger:\n- `test_returns_at_least_one_target_requirement`: get_targets returns a list with at least one requirement.\n- `test_target_requirement_is_valid_type`: Returned object is a TargetRequirement.\n- `test_target_accepts_player`: Filter accepts any player (either player is a valid target).\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTruceTokenCreation (6 tests)\nValidates the Inkling token creation on ETB:\n- `test_target_player_gets_token`: Target player receives exactly one token.\n- `test_token_is_creature`: Token is a Creature instance with is_token=True.\n- `test_token_is_inkling`: Token has \"Inkling\" subtype.\n- `test_token_power_toughness`: Token is 1/1.\n- `test_token_has_flying`: Token has Keyword.FLYING.\n- `test_controller_can_target_self_for_token`: Controller can target themselves.\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTrucePreparedCondition (4 tests)\nValidates the conditional prepared designation:\n- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures`: Prepared when opponent has strictly more creatures.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_equal_creatures`: Not prepared when counts are equal.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_controller_has_more_creatures`: Not prepared when controller has more.\n- `test_becomes_prepared_targeting_self_opponent_still_has_more`: Prepared even when self-targeting if opponent still has more.\n\n### TestEmeritusOfTruceEdgeCases (4 tests)\nEdge cases and boundary conditions:\n- `test_on_resolve_no_chosen_targets_does_not_crash`: No crash when chosen_targets is unset.\n- `test_on_resolve_empty_chosen_targets_does_not_crash`: No crash when chosen_targets is empty.\n- `test_opponent_has_no_creatures_token_given_to_opponent`: Equal counts (1 vs 1) does not trigger prepared.\n- `test_token_on_opponent_side_tips_balance`: Giving token to opponent can tip the balance to trigger prepared.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **Swords to Plowshares prepare spell functionality**: The prepared mechanic\n  involves creating a copy of the prepare spell in exile and allowing it to be\n  cast. This requires engine infrastructure for \"prepared designation\" and\n  \"create a copy of the prepare spell\" that does not currently exist in the\n  engine. Documented in untestable.json.\n- **Token color identity (white AND black)**: The engine does not have a clear\n  \"colors\" attribute on creatures in the current API, so we cannot assert\n  white-and-black color identity on the token. We verify subtypes and keywords\n  instead.\n","numLines":61,"startLine":1,"totalLines":61}}}
