{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ck7n6HY5isagVyW9oCH499","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_13\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable Items Resolution\n4\t\n5\t### 1. Prepared mechanic / Swords to Plowshares\n6\t**Decision**: The Implementer should implement the full prepare mechanic including:\n7\t- A `is_prepared` / `prepared` flag on the permanent\n8\t- The condition: \"This permanent becomes prepared if the opponent controls more creatures\"\n9\t- The ability to cast a copy of Swords to Plowshares from exile while prepared, which unprepares it\n10\t- Swords to Plowshares effect: exile target creature, its controller gains life equal to its power\n11\t\n12\tThe Tester's tests cover the prepared condition (becomes prepared when opponent has more creatures). The Implementer should make those tests pass and implement the full prepare spell functionality even if not all aspects are tested.\n13\t\n14\t### 2. Token colors (white and black)\n15\t**Decision**: Accept partial coverage. The Implementer should set `colors` on the Inkling token if the engine supports it, but the tests only check name, subtypes, P/T, and flying. If colors need engine support, add a `colors` attribute to cards.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmsndJiRpYV9ifKJBLLPN6","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"3fedcc47-becf-4de9-ad53-69968da68ff4","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:34:48.569Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_13"}
