{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MdN8mEjeHb5KbQ2EQLDqkq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale for sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares)\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t### Class Hierarchy\n6\t- Extends `Creature` since the front face is a 3/3 creature. The card name is set to \"Emeritus of Truce\" (the front face name only), matching the test expectation.\n7\t\n8\t### ETB Trigger\n9\t- Registers an `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent` trigger via `register_triggers()`, with a condition that checks `event.permanent is source` to ensure it only triggers on self-entry.\n10\t- The trigger effect delegates to `on_resolve()` so the same token-creation and prepared-check logic is used whether the trigger fires naturally or the test calls `on_resolve()` directly.\n11\t\n12\t### Targeting\n13\t- `get_targets()` returns a single `TargetRequirement` with a `filter_fn` that accepts any `Player` instance. This supports targeting both self and opponents for the token creation.\n14\t\n15\t### Token Creation\n16\t- Uses `engine.game.create_token()` to create a 1/1 Inkling creature token with flying under the target player's control.\n17\t- Token has `subtypes={\"Inkling\"}`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING`, and `colors=[\"W\", \"B\"]` for white and black.\n18\t\n19\t### Prepared Condition\n20\t- After token creation, iterates over all players that are not the controller. If any opponent controls more creatures than the controller, sets `self.is_prepared = True`.\n21\t- Creature counting uses `CardType.CREATURE in card_types` check on all objects on each player's battlefield.\n22\t- The `is_prepared` flag defaults to `False` in `__init__` and is only set to `True` when the condition is met.\n23\t\n24\t### Edge Cases\n25\t- `on_resolve()` gracefully handles missing or empty `chosen_targets` by returning early (no-op).\n26\t- The prepared check correctly handles equal counts (not prepared) and strictly-more cases.\n27\t\n28\t## No Engine Modifications\n29\tNo engine files were modified. The existing engine API (triggers, events, token creation, zones) was sufficient.\n30\t\n31\t## Conventions\n32\t- Player detection uses `isinstance(obj, Player)` from `engine.player`.\n33\t- Token colors are set as a list attribute `colors = [\"W\", \"B\"]` on the token object.\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RSxdPURqSEmkgi1J5XTBqG","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"4f8a0399-e9b7-4e79-9265-afa2887c365c","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:37:02.931Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_13 implementation"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015pWE29RXdHb22JQCQTBK9h","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"cards\": [\n3\t    {\n4\t      \"card\": \"sos_1\",\n5\t      \"tests\": [\n6\t        {\n7\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\",\n8\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_1 The Dawning Archaic: static properties, cost reduction, attack trigger registration/condition, graveyard targeting, free cast, exile replacement, edge cases\"\n9\t        }\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"implementation\": [\n12\t        {\n13\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py\",\n14\t          \"summary\": \"The Dawning Archaic creature with context-aware get_targets (returns [] during casting, trigger targets otherwise), cost reduction, attack trigger for free-cast from graveyard, exile replacement\"\n15\t        }\n16\t      ]\n17\t    },\n18\t    {\n19\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n20\t      \"tests\": [\n21\t        {\n22\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n23\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce: static properties, ETB trigger registration/condition, player targeting, Inkling token creation, prepared condition, edge cases\"\n24\t        }\n25\t      ],\n26\t      \"implementation\": [\n27\t        {\n28\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n29\t          \"summary\": \"Emeritus of Truce creature with ETB trigger creating 1/1 Inkling token with flying for target player, prepared condition when opponent controls more creatures\"\n30\t        }\n31\t      ]\n32\t    },\n33\t    {\n34\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n35\t      \"tests\": [\n36\t        {\n37\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n38\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_4 Together as One: static properties, targeting (player + any target), converge colors_spent, draw X, deal X damage, gain X life, zero colors edge case, no targets edge case, Color list format\"\n39\t        }\n40\t      ],\n41\t      \"implementation\": [\n42\t        {\n43\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n44\t          \"summary\": \"Together as One sorcery with converge: colors_spent tracking (int or Color list), two target requirements, on_resolve draws X for target player, deals X damage to any target, controller gains X life with GainsLifeTriggeredEvent\"\n45\t        }\n46\t      ]\n47\t    }\n48\t  ]\n49\t}\n50\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RSxdPURqSEmkgi1J5XTBqG","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"d1798612-52d1-4967-83b8-174ac519800f","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:37:02.932Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_13 implementation"}
