{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014HKEjMgMwJeKjVZ5dnSMU1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LaTRgdprwwrk9zo7u3MXsT","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 57 -- Mana Sculpt\n\n## Card Summary\n\nMana Sculpt is a {1}{U}{U} Instant with oracle text:\n\"Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add an amount of {C} equal to the amount of mana spent to cast that spell at the beginning of your next main phase.\"\n\nThis card has two effects:\n1. Counter target spell (unconditional counterspell).\n2. Conditional mana rebate: if you control a Wizard, create a delayed triggered ability that adds {C} equal to the countered spell's mana value at the beginning of your next main phase.\n\n## Test File\n\n**Path:** `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`\n\n### TestManaSculptProperties (4 tests)\n- `test_is_instant` -- Validates the card is an Instant subclass.\n- `test_name` -- Card name matches \"Mana Sculpt\".\n- `test_mana_cost` -- Mana cost is {1}{U}{U}.\n- `test_has_instant_card_type` -- CardType.INSTANT is present.\n\n### TestManaSculptTargeting (6 tests)\n- `test_returns_at_least_one_target_requirement` -- get_targets() returns a list with at least one requirement.\n- `test_target_requirement_is_target_requirement_type` -- The requirement is a TargetRequirement object.\n- `test_target_zone_is_stack` -- The target zone is Zone.STACK (targeting a spell).\n- `test_target_filter_accepts_spell` -- Filter accepts an Instant spell.\n- `test_target_filter_accepts_sorcery_spell` -- Filter accepts a Sorcery spell.\n- `test_target_filter_accepts_creature_spell` -- Filter accepts a creature spell (counter ANY spell).\n\n### TestManaSculptCounterEffect (4 tests)\n- `test_countered_spell_goes_to_graveyard` -- The targeted spell is moved to its owner's graveyard.\n- `test_countered_spell_removed_from_stack_zone` -- The spell is removed from the stack zone.\n- `test_no_target_is_noop` -- Resolving with no chosen_targets does not crash.\n- `test_empty_chosen_targets_does_not_raise` -- Resolving with empty chosen_targets is safe.\n\n### TestManaSculptWithoutWizard (2 tests)\n- `test_counter_works_without_wizard` -- The spell is countered even without a Wizard.\n- `test_no_delayed_trigger_without_wizard` -- No delayed trigger is registered when no Wizard is controlled.\n\n### TestManaSculptWithWizard (6 tests)\n- `test_counter_still_works_with_wizard` -- The spell is countered with a Wizard present.\n- `test_delayed_trigger_registered_with_wizard` -- A delayed trigger is registered when a Wizard is controlled.\n- `test_mana_rebate_amount_matches_spell_cmc` -- Rebate of 3 colorless for a {2}{R} spell.\n- `test_mana_rebate_for_one_mana_spell` -- Rebate of 1 colorless for a {R} spell.\n- `test_mana_rebate_for_expensive_spell` -- Rebate of 6 colorless for a {4}{U}{U} spell.\n- `test_mana_rebate_adds_colorless` -- The mana added is specifically colorless ({C}), not colored.\n\n### TestManaSculptWizardDetection (3 tests)\n- `test_wizard_subtype_detected` -- A creature with the \"Wizard\" subtype enables the rebate.\n- `test_non_wizard_creature_does_not_trigger_rebate` -- A creature without Wizard subtype does not enable the rebate.\n- `test_opponent_wizard_does_not_count` -- An opponent's Wizard does not count for \"you control a Wizard\".\n\n### TestManaSculptZeroManaSpell (1 test)\n- `test_zero_cmc_spell_gives_zero_mana` -- A zero-cost spell results in zero mana added.\n\n## Edge Cases Covered\n- No Wizard on battlefield: counter still works, no mana rebate.\n- Opponent's Wizard: does not count as \"you control a Wizard\".\n- Non-Wizard creature: does not enable the rebate.\n- Zero-mana spell: rebate is zero.\n- No target / empty targets: no crash on resolution.\n- Various CMC values (1, 3, 6): verify rebate scales correctly.\n- Mana type verification: only colorless mana is added, not colored.\n\n## Edge Cases NOT Covered (out of scope)\n- \"At the beginning of your next main phase\" timing: Testing the exact trigger timing (precombat vs postcombat main phase) would require a full turn-cycle simulation which is complex infrastructure. The delayed trigger registration and effect are tested instead. This is partially covered by verifying the trigger is registered.\n- Interaction with other counterspells: testing Mana Sculpt being countered itself is engine-level behavior.\n- X spells on the stack: the oracle text says \"mana spent to cast that spell\" which could differ from CMC for X spells. This edge case is deferred as the engine does not track actual mana spent on a per-spell basis separately from the mana cost.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6462,"cache_read_input_tokens":73488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6462,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XzCZqgsH1FfbXSx1FmPLxk","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"d41a84f7-1ce7-4bfb-a6bf-92ae6ffc6921","request_id":"req_011CbUkFNGAh421XPpHK2fgD","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_57"}
