{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018xevQHEF1frDoUGSppe5JA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EbafQuQvR8HJ65qZRsYD3T","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revision Rationale for sos_57 (Mana Sculpt)\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Specific event type for delayed trigger (strict comment #1)\n- Added `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` to `engine/events.py` as a new dataclass subclass of `TriggeredEvent`, with a `player` field to identify whose main phase it is.\n- Changed the trigger's `event_type` from the base `TriggeredEvent` to `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`.\n- Added a `_condition` callback that checks `event.player is controller`, ensuring the trigger only fires during the controller's own main phase.\n\n### 2. One-shot self-removing trigger (strict comment #2)\n- The `_effect` closure now calls `game.trigger_manager.unregister(source)` after adding mana, making the delayed trigger fire exactly once and then remove itself from the trigger manager.\n- This correctly models MTG delayed triggers which are consumed after their single use.\n\n## Design Decisions\n- The new `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` is an additive addition to `engine/events.py`, following the established pattern of other beginning-of-phase events (`BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent`, `BeginningOfCombatTriggeredEvent`).\n- The `player` field on the event allows conditions to check whose phase it is.\n- Self-unregistration uses the existing `TriggerManager.unregister(source)` API which removes all triggers for that source -- appropriate here since each Mana Sculpt instance registers at most one delayed trigger.\n\n## Tests\nAll 26 existing tests pass. No test modifications were made. The tests call `trigger.effect(game)` directly which still works because the trigger object reference persists even after unregistration from the manager.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1776,"cache_read_input_tokens":33285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1776,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016kFwMy3kMQXDhEHLfVqq45","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"384f2260-d79e-4c3b-8298-cbdda9055812","request_id":"req_011CbUkgKJ2ESKV8xunM2BSh","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_57 per review"}
