{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Hx6w8tLoEJaUVfYQV2Xnw4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Pjpr5jSMDjcWxuDXGryzRG","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale for sos_97 (Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer)\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n1. **Planeswalker base class**: Extended `Planeswalker` from `engine.card` following the same pattern as existing FDN planeswalker implementations (e.g., `fdn_81` Chandra, `fdn_44` Kaito).\n\n2. **Four loyalty abilities via `get_loyalty_abilities()`**: Returns `[+1, -1, -2, -7]` as `LoyaltyAbility` objects, each with a closure over the planeswalker instance (`pw = self`).\n\n3. **+1 Surveil 2**: Simplified implementation that moves top 2 library cards to graveyard. Handles edge cases of fewer than 2 cards and empty library gracefully.\n\n4. **-1 Discard**: Reads targets from `_resolve_targets` (falling back to `chosen_targets`), iterates over target players, and discards the last card in hand using `engine.game.discard`. Safe with empty hands.\n\n5. **-2 Reanimate**: Reads target from `_resolve_target` (falling back to `chosen_targets[0]`). Uses `move_zone` to move from graveyard to battlefield. Target filter function (`_is_creature_mv_le_3`) checks `CardType.CREATURE` membership and `mana_cost.cmc <= 3`.\n\n6. **-7 Ultimate (coin flip)**: Supports deterministic testing via `_coin_results` attribute (list of booleans). Falls back to `random.choice` for non-test contexts. Applies `skip_turns` counter to target opponent.\n\n7. **Targeting**: `get_targets()` returns a single `TargetRequirement` for the -2 ability (graveyard creature with MV <= 3). The other abilities handle targeting through `_resolve_targets`/`chosen_targets` set by test code or engine.\n\n## No engine modifications needed\n\nAll behavior was implementable using existing engine APIs (`move_zone`, `discard`, `Planeswalker`, `LoyaltyAbility`, `TargetRequirement`).\n\n## Conventions\n\n- Turn-skipping uses `player.skip_turns` integer counter attribute, dynamically added when the ultimate resolves. This is consistent with the test's check for `getattr(p2, \"skip_turns\", 0) > 0`.\n- Coin flip results can be injected via `card._coin_results` for deterministic testing.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":124,"cache_read_input_tokens":61802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":124,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VMNsWLapgFBmu6Up6EteGZ","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"9c14f2d8-6b44-4959-a22b-04ea7b706c19","request_id":"req_011CbUm92A954ajU4imQaG2X","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_97"}
