{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DawVC237QLZhv3VNxQvNBJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale for sos_97 (Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer)\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t1. **Planeswalker base class**: Extended `Planeswalker` from `engine.card` following the same pattern as existing FDN planeswalker implementations (e.g., `fdn_81` Chandra, `fdn_44` Kaito).\n6\t\n7\t2. **Four loyalty abilities via `get_loyalty_abilities()`**: Returns `[+1, -1, -2, -7]` as `LoyaltyAbility` objects, each with a closure over the planeswalker instance (`pw = self`).\n8\t\n9\t3. **+1 Surveil 2**: Simplified implementation that moves top 2 library cards to graveyard. Handles edge cases of fewer than 2 cards and empty library gracefully.\n10\t\n11\t4. **-1 Discard**: Reads targets from `_resolve_targets` (falling back to `chosen_targets`), iterates over target players, and discards the last card in hand using `engine.game.discard`. Safe with empty hands.\n12\t\n13\t5. **-2 Reanimate**: Reads target from `_resolve_target` (falling back to `chosen_targets[0]`). Uses `move_zone` to move from graveyard to battlefield. Target filter function (`_is_creature_mv_le_3`) checks `CardType.CREATURE` membership and `mana_cost.cmc <= 3`.\n14\t\n15\t6. **-7 Ultimate (coin flip)**: Supports deterministic testing via `_coin_results` attribute (list of booleans). Falls back to `random.choice` for non-test contexts. Applies `skip_turns` counter to target opponent.\n16\t\n17\t7. **Targeting**: `get_targets()` returns a single `TargetRequirement` for the -2 ability (graveyard creature with MV <= 3). The other abilities handle targeting through `_resolve_targets`/`chosen_targets` set by test code or engine.\n18\t\n19\t## No engine modifications needed\n20\t\n21\tAll behavior was implementable using existing engine APIs (`move_zone`, `discard`, `Planeswalker`, `LoyaltyAbility`, `TargetRequirement`).\n22\t\n23\t## Conventions\n24\t\n25\t- Turn-skipping uses `player.skip_turns` integer counter attribute, dynamically added when the ultimate resolves. This is consistent with the test's check for `getattr(p2, \"skip_turns\", 0) > 0`.\n26\t- Coin flip results can be injected via `card._coin_results` for deterministic testing.\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GrmWnu9DHQeBxsFqSJEsVC","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"d7517f5e-bdb9-47e6-971d-deaaf2fbb892","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:53:17.925Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_97 implementation"}
