{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CtrABE3tmtUgz7oCronYBH","type":"tool_result","content":"1433-[Omitted long context line]\n1434-\n1435:205.3k Instants and sorceries share their lists of subtypes; these subtypes are called spell types. The spell types are Adventure, Arcane, Lesson, Omen, and Trap.\n1436-\n1437-[Omitted long context line]\n--\n3693-701.48. Learn\n3694-\n3695:701.48a “Learn” means “You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card. If you didn’t discard a card, you may reveal a Lesson card you own from outside the game and put it into your hand.”\n3696-\n3697-701.49. Venture into the Dungeon\n--\n8141-\n8142-Learn\n8143:A keyword action that lets a player add a Lesson card to their hand from outside the game or discard a card to draw a card. See rule 701.48, “Learn.”\n8144-\n8145-Leaves the Battlefield"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QCBW6ooPfaYqp7MLVWKPD3","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"36c78247-a416-4e05-b338-d17cc33efb66","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:57:21.524Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_120"}
