{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ec6MuKB3p5wKaYgGubhn7E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011p66dKKPSiThWZCoSbutDR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_120 Improvisation Capstone\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Card Structure\n- Extends `Sorcery` base class with Lesson subtype, matching the card spec.\n- Mana cost `{5}{R}{R}` (CMC 7) set via `ManaCost.parse`.\n\n### Main Effect: Exile from Library\n- Iterates from the top of the library, removing and exiling cards one at a time.\n- Tracks running total of mana values; stops when total >= 4 or library is empty.\n- Cards with no `mana_cost` attribute contribute 0 to the total.\n\n### Free-Cast from Exile\n- Key design: exiled cards remain in exile after `on_resolve` completes. StackObjects are pushed for each castable spell, and their `on_resolve` callbacks handle moving the card from exile to its destination (battlefield for creatures, graveyard for instants/sorceries).\n- This deferred approach is necessary because tests check the exile zone immediately after `on_resolve` (before stack resolution) and expect the exiled library cards to still be present.\n- Lands are skipped since they are not spells.\n- Used closure factories (`_make_creature_resolve`, `_make_spell_resolve`) to capture card references correctly in the loop.\n\n### Paradigm: Self-Exile\n- After the main effect, the spell itself is moved from the stack zone to exile.\n- Checks both the stack zone and exile zone to avoid duplicates.\n\n### Paradigm: Recurring Trigger\n- Registers a delayed trigger via `TriggerManager` that watches for `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`.\n- Condition checks that `event.player` matches the controller.\n- Effect creates a new `ImprovisationCapstone` instance (the \"copy\") and pushes it onto the stack as a StackObject with its own `on_resolve`.\n\n## Conventions Established\n- For cards that exile from library then free-cast: keep cards in exile, push StackObjects for deferred casting.\n- Paradigm pattern: self-exile + delayed trigger for `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` with controller condition check.\n\n## No Engine Modifications\n- No engine files were modified. All behavior is implemented within the card class using existing engine APIs.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":161,"cache_read_input_tokens":70789,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":161,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBQptWsM57uJ5kEiw8L9Hs","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"6a2d8d6e-6c0d-4471-87ab-1b4b097a4a71","request_id":"req_011CbUmwPkSwhRsYwyfMoQug","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_120"}
