{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015MocZ4ixaS9gZ63xeFuxkA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01STrRkfHU6Ue7gQEaYZSDAn","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revised Implementation Rationale for sos_120\n\n## Fix 1: Exponential trigger accumulation\n\n**Problem:** When the paradigm trigger fires and creates a copy, `_copy_resolve` called `capstone_copy.on_resolve(g)`, which runs the full `on_resolve` including `_paradigm_register_recurrence`. This registered ANOTHER trigger, causing exponential growth: 1 -> 2 -> 4 -> 8 triggers per main phase.\n\n**Fix:** Changed `_copy_resolve` to only call the two relevant helper methods directly:\n- `capstone_copy._exile_from_library(g, capstone_controller)` -- exile cards from library\n- `capstone_copy._free_cast_exiled(g, capstone_controller, exiled)` -- free-cast the exiled spells\n\nThis skips `_paradigm_self_exile` and `_paradigm_register_recurrence`, preventing the copy from registering additional triggers. Only the original resolution registers the recurring trigger.\n\n## Fix 2: Non-creature permanents go to wrong zone\n\n**Problem:** The else-branch in `_free_cast_exiled` treated ALL non-creature, non-land cards as instants/sorceries, sending them to the graveyard on resolution. Enchantments, artifacts, and planeswalkers are permanents and should go to the battlefield.\n\n**Fix:** Changed the branching logic to explicitly check for instants/sorceries (via `CardType.INSTANT`, `CardType.SORCERY`, or `isinstance` checks). Added a new else-branch for other permanents (enchantments, artifacts, planeswalkers) that resolves them to the battlefield, similar to the creature branch but without `summoning_sick`.\n\nThe branching order is now:\n1. Creatures -> battlefield (with summoning sickness)\n2. Instants/Sorceries -> graveyard\n3. Other permanents (enchantments, artifacts, planeswalkers) -> battlefield\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":123,"cache_read_input_tokens":25687,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":123,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013kGVzSYUhNgLJ9L6CnZfuC","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"48ea1161-d192-4aac-8030-c8966aa6536f","request_id":"req_011CbUnBffYWqqjgpD3c9c1z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Revise sos_120 per review"}
