{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013kGVzSYUhNgLJ9L6CnZfuC","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 23 card tests and all 1145 engine tests pass.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\nfiles_changed: 1\ntests_passing: all (23 card tests + 1145 engine tests)\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised-rationale.md\nnotes: Fixed both strict issues: (1) paradigm copy resolve now only calls _exile_from_library and _free_cast_exiled, preventing exponential trigger accumulation; (2) non-creature permanents (enchantments, artifacts, planeswalkers) now correctly route to battlefield instead of graveyard, with explicit instant/sorcery check for graveyard routing."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a6b9bb05d13d345b2 (use SendMessage with to: 'a6b9bb05d13d345b2' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 39584\ntool_uses: 19\nduration_ms: 90505</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"309452e2-0bd7-4a93-9069-8585a77ee7c9","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:06:54.772Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"\n## Task\nRevise **sos_120** to address two strict review comments. MUST NOT modify test files.\n\n## Strict comments\n\n### 1. Exponential trigger accumulation (line ~221)\nWhen the paradigm trigger fires and creates a copy, calling `capstone_copy.on_resolve(g)` runs the full on_resolve including `_paradigm_register_recurrence`, registering ANOTHER trigger. This causes exponential growth: 1 → 2 → 4 → 8 triggers. Fix: the copy's resolve should only do the exile-from-library and free-cast steps, skipping paradigm self-exile and trigger registration.\n\n### 2. Non-creature permanents go to wrong zone (line ~159)\nThe else-branch treats all non-creature, non-land cards as instants/sorceries (sending to graveyard on resolution). Enchantments, artifacts, and planeswalkers should go to the battlefield like creatures.\n\n## What to do\n1. Read current: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/card_impl.py`\n2. Read tests: `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py`\n3. Fix both issues while keeping all tests passing.\n\n## Verification\nRun: `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py -v --tb=short`\nRun: `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ --tb=short -q`\n\n## Output\n1. Rationale → `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised-rationale.md`\n2. Disagreements → `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/disagreements.json`\n\nReturn REVISION_DONE with disagreement_count.\n","agentId":"a6b9bb05d13d345b2","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 23 card tests and all 1145 engine tests pass.\n\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\nfiles_changed: 1\ntests_passing: all (23 card tests + 1145 engine tests)\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/impl-revised-rationale.md\nnotes: Fixed both strict issues: (1) paradigm copy resolve now only calls _exile_from_library and _free_cast_exiled, preventing exponential trigger accumulation; (2) non-creature permanents (enchantments, artifacts, planeswalkers) now correctly route to battlefield instead of graveyard, with explicit instant/sorcery check for graveyard routing."}],"totalDurationMs":90505,"totalTokens":39584,"totalToolUseCount":19,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_read_input_tokens":36138,"output_tokens":192,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3253},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":192,"cache_read_input_tokens":36138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":7,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":7,"editFileCo