{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GkgFvRQN8NS21RyZLCj6hg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LQfoMfHrykP1AxnQjkDa5n","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 201 — Lorehold, the Historian\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`\n\n### TestLoreholdTheHistorianProperties (9 tests)\nValidates all static card properties against the card spec:\n- **test_is_creature**: Card must be a Creature instance.\n- **test_name**: Name must be \"Lorehold, the Historian\".\n- **test_mana_cost**: Must be {3}{R}{W}.\n- **test_power_toughness**: Base power/toughness must be 5/5.\n- **test_is_legendary**: Must have Supertype.LEGENDARY.\n- **test_has_elder_dragon_subtypes**: Must have \"Elder\" and \"Dragon\" subtypes.\n- **test_has_flying**: Must have Keyword.FLYING.\n- **test_has_haste**: Must have Keyword.HASTE.\n- **test_has_creature_type**: Must have CardType.CREATURE.\n\n### TestLoreholdMiracleGranting (6 tests)\nValidates the miracle-granting static ability: \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\"\n- **test_instant_in_hand_gains_miracle**: An instant in hand should have miracle_cost = {2}.\n- **test_sorcery_in_hand_gains_miracle**: A sorcery in hand should have miracle_cost = {2}.\n- **test_creature_in_hand_does_not_gain_miracle**: Creatures should not get miracle.\n- **test_enchantment_in_hand_does_not_gain_miracle**: Enchantments should not get miracle.\n- **test_miracle_cost_is_two_generic**: Verifies the cost is exactly {2} even for expensive spells.\n- **test_opponent_instants_do_not_gain_miracle**: Only controller's hand, not opponent's.\n\n### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerRegistration (2 tests)\nValidates trigger registration for the upkeep ability.\n- **test_registers_trigger**: register_triggers adds at least one trigger.\n- **test_registered_trigger_watches_upkeep_event**: Trigger must watch BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent.\n\n### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerCondition (2 tests)\nValidates the condition restricting the trigger to opponent's upkeeps only.\n- **test_trigger_fires_on_opponent_upkeep**: Trigger condition returns True when active player is opponent.\n- **test_trigger_does_not_fire_on_own_upkeep**: Trigger condition returns False on controller's own upkeep.\n\n### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerEffect (4 tests)\nValidates the looting effect: \"you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"\n- **test_looting_discards_a_card**: When choosing yes, the chosen card moves from hand to graveyard.\n- **test_looting_draws_a_card_after_discard**: After discarding, a card is drawn from library to hand.\n- **test_may_choose_not_to_discard**: When choosing no, hand and library are unchanged.\n- **test_empty_hand_no_discard_no_draw**: With empty hand, the trigger resolves safely without error.\n\n### TestLoreholdEdgeCases (4 tests)\nEdge cases and integration checks.\n- **test_multiple_instants_all_gain_miracle**: All instants/sorceries gain miracle, not just the first.\n- **test_mixed_hand_only_instants_sorceries_gain_miracle**: In a mixed hand, only the right types gain miracle.\n- **test_trigger_fires_event_onto_stack**: Verifies the trigger actually pushes onto the stack.\n- **test_trigger_controller_is_lorehold_controller**: Trigger controller matches Lorehold's controller.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n- **Miracle casting mechanics**: The actual \"reveal from hand when drawn as first card this turn\" mechanic is a complex engine interaction. Tests verify that miracle_cost is granted; the engine's miracle casting pipeline is outside this card's scope.\n- **Lorehold leaving the battlefield removes miracle**: This is a continuous effect layer concern. The tests verify the granting behavior; removing it when Lorehold leaves is an engine-level continuous effect behavior.\n- **Multiple Loreholds**: Redundancy of the miracle granting is not card-specific behavior worth testing (the effect is identical regardless of count).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6878,"cache_read_input_tokens":53271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6878,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FbRy9cm6u8x9yH3NFj1qpk","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"e216e883-720c-4959-9b36-937d4b7c30a0","request_id":"req_011CbUnQuSdpB3cgwb92EMn3","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_201"}
