{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ULoKh3iF2MgZbDca9iapZN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 201 — Lorehold, the Historian\n2\t\n3\t## File: `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`\n4\t\n5\t### TestLoreholdTheHistorianProperties (9 tests)\n6\tValidates all static card properties against the card spec:\n7\t- **test_is_creature**: Card must be a Creature instance.\n8\t- **test_name**: Name must be \"Lorehold, the Historian\".\n9\t- **test_mana_cost**: Must be {3}{R}{W}.\n10\t- **test_power_toughness**: Base power/toughness must be 5/5.\n11\t- **test_is_legendary**: Must have Supertype.LEGENDARY.\n12\t- **test_has_elder_dragon_subtypes**: Must have \"Elder\" and \"Dragon\" subtypes.\n13\t- **test_has_flying**: Must have Keyword.FLYING.\n14\t- **test_has_haste**: Must have Keyword.HASTE.\n15\t- **test_has_creature_type**: Must have CardType.CREATURE.\n16\t\n17\t### TestLoreholdMiracleGranting (6 tests)\n18\tValidates the miracle-granting static ability: \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\"\n19\t- **test_instant_in_hand_gains_miracle**: An instant in hand should have miracle_cost = {2}.\n20\t- **test_sorcery_in_hand_gains_miracle**: A sorcery in hand should have miracle_cost = {2}.\n21\t- **test_creature_in_hand_does_not_gain_miracle**: Creatures should not get miracle.\n22\t- **test_enchantment_in_hand_does_not_gain_miracle**: Enchantments should not get miracle.\n23\t- **test_miracle_cost_is_two_generic**: Verifies the cost is exactly {2} even for expensive spells.\n24\t- **test_opponent_instants_do_not_gain_miracle**: Only controller's hand, not opponent's.\n25\t\n26\t### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerRegistration (2 tests)\n27\tValidates trigger registration for the upkeep ability.\n28\t- **test_registers_trigger**: register_triggers adds at least one trigger.\n29\t- **test_registered_trigger_watches_upkeep_event**: Trigger must watch BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent.\n30\t\n31\t### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerCondition (2 tests)\n32\tValidates the condition restricting the trigger to opponent's upkeeps only.\n33\t- **test_trigger_fires_on_opponent_upkeep**: Trigger condition returns True when active player is opponent.\n34\t- **test_trigger_does_not_fire_on_own_upkeep**: Trigger condition returns False on controller's own upkeep.\n35\t\n36\t### TestLoreholdUpkeepTriggerEffect (4 tests)\n37\tValidates the looting effect: \"you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"\n38\t- **test_looting_discards_a_card**: When choosing yes, the chosen card moves from hand to graveyard.\n39\t- **test_looting_draws_a_card_after_discard**: After discarding, a card is drawn from library to hand.\n40\t- **test_may_choose_not_to_discard**: When choosing no, hand and library are unchanged.\n41\t- **test_empty_hand_no_discard_no_draw**: With empty hand, the trigger resolves safely without error.\n42\t\n43\t### TestLoreholdEdgeCases (4 tests)\n44\tEdge cases and integration checks.\n45\t- **test_multiple_instants_all_gain_miracle**: All instants/sorceries gain miracle, not just the first.\n46\t- **test_mixed_hand_only_instants_sorceries_gain_miracle**: In a mixed hand, only the right types gain miracle.\n47\t- **test_trigger_fires_event_onto_stack**: Verifies the trigger actually pushes onto the stack.\n48\t- **test_trigger_controller_is_lorehold_controller**: Trigger controller matches Lorehold's controller.\n49\t\n50\t## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n51\t- **Miracle casting mechanics**: The actual \"reveal from hand when drawn as first card this turn\" mechanic is a complex engine interaction. Tests verify that miracle_cost is granted; the engine's miracle casting pipeline is outside this card's scope.\n52\t- **Lorehold leaving the battlefield removes miracle**: This is a continuous effect layer concern. The tests verify the granting behavior; removing it when Lorehold leaves is an engine-level continuous effect behavior.\n53\t- **Multiple Loreholds**: Redundancy of the miracle granting is not card-specific behavior worth testing (the effect is identical regardless of count).\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LxNx53rTAeE5hJxNfLZLEC","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"4adc8e0d-2c7a-4e76-924a-7f36bde38299","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:12:38.355Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_201"}
