{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AeUhSN2YRxJsMWkugNEc7g","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/casting.py:89:def get_cost_reduction(game: GameState, card: CardImpl, controller: Player) -> int:\nengine/casting.py:92:    Queries ``card.cost_reduction(game)`` and clamps the result so that\nengine/casting.py:103:    raw = card.cost_reduction(game)\nengine/casting.py:105:    # side-effect (get_cost_reduction is a query, not a mutation).\nengine/casting.py:111:def _apply_cost_reduction(cost: ManaCost, reduction: int) -> ManaCost:\nengine/casting.py:209:    # Ensure the card knows its controller so that cost_reduction() hooks\nengine/casting.py:215:    reduction = get_cost_reduction(game, card, player)\nengine/casting.py:216:    effective_cost = _apply_cost_reduction(card.mana_cost, reduction) if reduction > 0 else card.mana_cost\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:15:[Omitted long matching line]\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:18:[Omitted long matching line]\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:32:- **`CardImpl`** — Interface all cards implement; hook methods define card-specific behavior. Includes `cost_reduction(game)` hook.\nengine/card.py:199:    def cost_reduction(self, game: GameState) -> int:\ncards/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:26:[Omitted long matching line]\nengine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:17:| `test_card.py` | GameObject IDs, CardImpl hook methods, Creature/Instant/Sorcery/Enchantment/Artifact/Planeswalker subclasses, Mode, ActivatedAbility, LoyaltyAbility, cost_reduction hook. |\nengine_tests/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:22:| `test_cost_reduction.py` | Cost reduction clamping, application, cast_spell integration. |\ncards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py:66:    def cost_reduction(self, game: GameState) -> int:\nengine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py:4:- CardImpl.cost_reduction() default returns 0\nengine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py:5:- get_cost_reduction returns the card's cost_reduction clamped to generic mana\nengine_tests/test_cost_reduction.py:6:- _apply_cos