{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D1yvks8xae2XVDMkeoFeKD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Rationale for SOS 245 — Witherbloom, the Balancer\n2\t\n3\t## File: cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\n4\t\n5\t### TestWitherbloomProperties (10 tests)\n6\tStatic card data validation matching the card spec.\n7\t\n8\t- `test_is_creature` — Verifies the class inherits from Creature.\n9\t- `test_name` — Name matches \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\".\n10\t- `test_mana_cost` — Mana cost is {6}{B}{G}.\n11\t- `test_mana_value_is_eight` — CMC is 8 (6 generic + B + G).\n12\t- `test_card_type_creature` — Has CREATURE card type.\n13\t- `test_supertype_legendary` — Has LEGENDARY supertype.\n14\t- `test_subtypes_elder_dragon` — Has \"Elder\" and \"Dragon\" subtypes.\n15\t- `test_power_toughness` — 5/5 base stats.\n16\t- `test_has_flying` — Has FLYING keyword.\n17\t- `test_has_deathtouch` — Has DEATHTOUCH keyword.\n18\t\n19\t### TestWitherbloomSelfAffinity (7 tests)\n20\tTests the card's own \"Affinity for creatures\" via `cost_reduction()`.\n21\t\n22\t- `test_no_creatures_no_reduction` — 0 creatures = 0 reduction.\n23\t- `test_one_creature_reduces_by_one` — 1 creature = 1 reduction.\n24\t- `test_three_creatures_reduces_by_three` — 3 creatures = 3 reduction.\n25\t- `test_six_creatures_reduces_by_six` — 6 creatures fully reduces generic (6).\n26\t- `test_opponent_creatures_do_not_count` — Only controller's creatures count.\n27\t- `test_non_creature_permanents_do_not_count` — Enchantments etc. are excluded.\n28\t- `test_excess_creatures_beyond_generic_cost` — cost_reduction returns raw count; clamping is the casting pipeline's job.\n29\t\n30\t### TestWitherbloomGrantsAffinityToInstants (7 tests)\n31\tTests the \"Instant and sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures\" ability. Uses `get_cost_reduction` from the casting pipeline to observe the effective reduction.\n32\t\n33\t- `test_instant_gets_cost_reduction_from_creatures` — An instant benefits from affinity when Witherbloom is on the battlefield.\n34\t- `test_sorcery_gets_cost_reduction_from_creatures` — A sorcery also benefits.\n35\t- `test_creature_spell_does_not_get_affinity` — Creature spells do not receive the granted affinity.\n36\t- `test_opponent_instant_does_not_get_affinity` — Opponent's spells are not affected.\n37\t- `test_affinity_counts_witherbloom_itself` — Witherbloom is a creature and counts for its own granting.\n38\t- `test_affinity_clamped_to_generic_cost` — Reduction is clamped to the spell's generic mana cost.\n39\t- `test_no_creatures_no_reduction_for_instant` — Without Witherbloom on the battlefield, instants get no bonus.\n40\t\n41\t### TestWitherbloomCastingWithAffinity (2 tests)\n42\tIntegration with the casting pipeline for Witherbloom's own cost.\n43\t\n44\t- `test_witherbloom_castable_with_fewer_mana_when_creatures_exist` — 3 creatures reduce generic from 6 to 3.\n45\t- `test_witherbloom_free_generic_with_six_creatures` — 6 creatures reduce generic to 0, only {B}{G} remains.\n46\t\n47\t### TestWitherbloomEdgeCases (2 tests)\n48\tBoundary and dynamic behavior tests.\n49\t\n50\t- `test_witherbloom_on_battlefield_counts_itself_for_own_spells` — When on the battlefield, it counts itself for granting affinity to instants/sorceries.\n51\t- `test_multiple_witherblooms_stack_affinity_on_self` — Creature count is dynamic, not snapshotted at registration time.\n52\t\n53\t## Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n54\t\n55\t- **Protection from colors**: Out of scope for this card; tested by the engine's protection tests.\n56\t- **Deathtouch combat interaction**: Engine-level behavior tested by engine_tests.\n57\t- **Flying blocking restrictions**: Engine-level behavior tested by engine_tests.\n58\t- **Multiple Witherblooms (legendary rule)**: The legendary rule is an engine-level SBA, not a card-specific behavior.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GS61Azx6HQbWwjw52LWJRE","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"daa2e7a6-6e56-43f0-ace5-39febe13dc71","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:30:25.403Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_245"}
