{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TTdctnnuGZ8NRHQiK3orWu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Yb1WMAoSR4UaSMVHiwk7ip","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale for SOS 257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py\n\n### TestGreatHallProperties (5 tests)\nValidates static card attributes that must match the card spec.\n\n- **test_is_land**: Card must be a `Land` subclass.\n- **test_name**: Name must be \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\".\n- **test_card_type_land**: Must include `CardType.LAND`.\n- **test_no_mana_cost**: Lands have no mana cost (empty ManaCost).\n- **test_cannot_be_cast**: Lands cannot be cast (`can_cast` returns False).\n\n### TestColorlessManaAbility (4 tests)\nValidates the first mana ability: `{T}: Add {C}`.\n\n- **test_has_colorless_mana_ability**: `get_mana_abilities()` must return at least one ManaAbility.\n- **test_colorless_ability_taps_land**: Activating the cost should tap the land.\n- **test_colorless_ability_adds_colorless_mana**: Producing mana should add {C} to the controller's pool.\n- **test_colorless_ability_fails_when_tapped**: Cost should fail if land is already tapped.\n\n### TestAnyColorManaAbility (4 tests)\nValidates the second mana ability: `{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color`.\n\n- **test_has_any_color_mana_ability**: `get_mana_abilities()` must return at least 2 abilities.\n- **test_any_color_ability_taps_and_pays_life**: Cost should tap the land AND deduct 1 life.\n- **test_any_color_ability_produces_colored_mana**: Should add one colored mana to the pool.\n- **test_any_color_ability_fails_when_tapped**: Cost should fail if land is already tapped.\n\n### TestAnimateAbility (6 tests)\nValidates the `{5}` activated ability that turns the land into a creature.\n\n- **test_has_activated_ability**: `get_activated_abilities()` must return at least one ability.\n- **test_animate_makes_creature**: After activation, land gains `CardType.CREATURE`.\n- **test_animate_still_land**: After animation, card retains `CardType.LAND`.\n- **test_animate_power_toughness**: Animated creature must be 2/4.\n- **test_animate_wizard_subtype**: Animated creature must have \"Wizard\" subtype.\n- **test_animate_does_nothing_if_already_creature**: \"If this land isn't a creature\" condition prevents re-animation.\n\n### TestAnimateTriggeredAbility (6 tests)\nValidates the triggered ability gained when animated: \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\"\n\n- **test_animate_registers_trigger**: After animation, a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger is registered.\n- **test_trigger_fires_for_instant**: Casting an instant grants +1/+0.\n- **test_trigger_fires_for_sorcery**: Casting a sorcery also grants +1/+0.\n- **test_trigger_does_not_fire_for_creature_spell**: Creature spells should not fire the trigger.\n- **test_trigger_stacks_multiple_casts**: Two casts should give +2/+0 total.\n- **test_trigger_only_fires_for_controllers_spells**: Opponent's spells should not trigger the ability.\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Already tapped land cannot activate mana abilities\n- Already-a-creature condition prevents redundant animation\n- Trigger condition filters: only instants/sorceries, only controller's spells\n- Multiple trigger stacking\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered (out of scope)\n- \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" restriction: This is a conditional mana spending restriction. The engine does not currently enforce mana spending restrictions at the casting pipeline level. The SecludedCourtyard reference implementation has the same limitation (marked as ENGINE LIMITATION). This cannot be meaningfully tested without engine support.\n- \"Until end of turn\" cleanup of +1/+0 bonus: Requires end-of-turn step processing which is engine-level behavior outside this card's scope.\n- The {5} cost payment verification (checking that 5 generic mana is deducted): This is handled by the activate_ability pipeline, not the card itself.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5729,"cache_read_input_tokens":58236,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5729,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNsRt9vvRNEj2p2fsNqzt3","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"cf719ca5-8a8f-45e7-85c7-3c0bc42f576e","request_id":"req_011CbUpN2Rj74HC7PqGPjFvr","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Write tests for sos_257"}
