ll turn-cycle integration. Accepted as partial coverage.\n- **Mana spent tracking**: Uses mana_cost.cmc as a proxy for \"mana spent to cast\". This is correct for non-X, non-additional-cost spells. Accepted as partial coverage.\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":6,"newStart":2,"newLines":9,"lines":[" "," Decisions made during this run only. Before the run ends, migrate anything worth preserving into `KEY_DECISIONS.md`."," ","+## sos_257: Accepted partial coverage","+- **Mana spending restrictions**: Engine doesn't support conditional mana spending (\"only to cast instant/sorcery\"). Same limitation as FDN 267 Secluded Courtyard. Accepted.","+"," ## sos_201: Accepted partial coverage"," - **Miracle casting flow**: Miracle keyword grant is tested (instants/sorceries in hand get miracle_cost), but the actual cast-on-draw flow requires engine-level draw tracking that doesn't exist. Accepted."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
