{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a8593dc39be52b848","tool_use_id":"toolu_01AJCZBiRc2QcPpZDHD6Jxhu","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Implementer","usage":{"total_tokens":68954,"tool_uses":32,"duration_ms":116762},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"c1e33a9d-5e95-4da0-bbec-46560845e8b4","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KuDrQXpPvH7xpZqq11siro","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01867H4ZHCR4T5K2VaRResYZ","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale for sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Base Class: Land\nThe card extends `Land` (not `CardImpl`), which provides `is_tapped`, `can_cast` returning False, and `CardType.LAND` automatically.\n\n### Mana Abilities\nTwo `ManaAbility` objects are returned from `get_mana_abilities()`:\n1. **Colorless ability**: Taps the land, adds {C} to controller's pool.\n2. **Any-color ability**: Taps the land, pays 1 life, adds one mana of any color (defaults to WHITE since the engine lacks a color-choice prompt for mana production).\n\nThe mana spending restriction (\"only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\") is not enforced -- the engine lacks conditional mana tracking. This is an accepted ENGINE LIMITATION.\n\n### Animate Ability ({5})\nAn `ActivatedAbility` that pays {5} from the controller's mana pool. On effect:\n- Checks the \"if this land isn't a creature\" condition by inspecting `card_types`.\n- Adds `CardType.CREATURE` and updates `_original_card_types` so the effect system preserves the creature type.\n- Sets `base_power=2`, `base_toughness=4`, `modified_power=2`, `modified_toughness=4`.\n- Adds \"Wizard\" to `subtypes`.\n- Registers the spell-cast trigger.\n\n### Power/Toughness Properties\nSince `Land` doesn't have `power`/`toughness` properties like `Creature` does, I added `power` and `toughness` properties that return `modified_power` and `modified_toughness` respectively. This mimics the `Creature` interface without requiring multiple inheritance.\n\n### Spell-Cast Trigger (+1/+0)\nUses `TriggerRegistration` with `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`. The condition checks:\n- The caster is the land's controller.\n- The spell is an instant or sorcery.\n\nThe effect directly increments `modified_power` for immediate visibility AND registers a `ContinuousEffect` with `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` at Layer 7c (MODIFY_PT) so the pump survives effect recalculations via `apply_all`.\n\n### Conventions\n- Follows the same trigger registration pattern used by sos_226 (Silverquill).\n- Uses `game.trigger_manager.unregister(card)` before registering to avoid duplicates.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":123,"cache_read_input_tokens":68349,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":123,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AJCZBiRc2QcPpZDHD6Jxhu","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"0ccb2fea-158f-4bbb-9cf8-398112baf090","request_id":"req_011CbUpauCWajTzsyKcPZXTY","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implement sos_257"}
