{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012K2FP2VdnyeTg6S1QkDKSF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation Rationale for sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n2\t\n3\t## Design Decisions\n4\t\n5\t### Base Class: Land\n6\tThe card extends `Land` (not `CardImpl`), which provides `is_tapped`, `can_cast` returning False, and `CardType.LAND` automatically.\n7\t\n8\t### Mana Abilities\n9\tTwo `ManaAbility` objects are returned from `get_mana_abilities()`:\n10\t1. **Colorless ability**: Taps the land, adds {C} to controller's pool.\n11\t2. **Any-color ability**: Taps the land, pays 1 life, adds one mana of any color (defaults to WHITE since the engine lacks a color-choice prompt for mana production).\n12\t\n13\tThe mana spending restriction (\"only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\") is not enforced -- the engine lacks conditional mana tracking. This is an accepted ENGINE LIMITATION.\n14\t\n15\t### Animate Ability ({5})\n16\tAn `ActivatedAbility` that pays {5} from the controller's mana pool. On effect:\n17\t- Checks the \"if this land isn't a creature\" condition by inspecting `card_types`.\n18\t- Adds `CardType.CREATURE` and updates `_original_card_types` so the effect system preserves the creature type.\n19\t- Sets `base_power=2`, `base_toughness=4`, `modified_power=2`, `modified_toughness=4`.\n20\t- Adds \"Wizard\" to `subtypes`.\n21\t- Registers the spell-cast trigger.\n22\t\n23\t### Power/Toughness Properties\n24\tSince `Land` doesn't have `power`/`toughness` properties like `Creature` does, I added `power` and `toughness` properties that return `modified_power` and `modified_toughness` respectively. This mimics the `Creature` interface without requiring multiple inheritance.\n25\t\n26\t### Spell-Cast Trigger (+1/+0)\n27\tUses `TriggerRegistration` with `SpellCastTriggeredEvent`. The condition checks:\n28\t- The caster is the land's controller.\n29\t- The spell is an instant or sorcery.\n30\t\n31\tThe effect directly increments `modified_power` for immediate visibility AND registers a `ContinuousEffect` with `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` at Layer 7c (MODIFY_PT) so the pump survives effect recalculations via `apply_all`.\n32\t\n33\t### Conventions\n34\t- Follows the same trigger registration pattern used by sos_226 (Silverquill).\n35\t- Uses `game.trigger_manager.unregister(card)` before registering to avoid duplicates.\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0161GfsJrvQwHK2xZfhhxMCo","session_id":"1fe34661-6a3c-4b16-8a42-0f618466dfcb","uuid":"60847140-afb0-46d9-835a-863c5201db6b","timestamp":"2026-05-28T10:38:30.831Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Review sos_257 implementation"}
